message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Be-NQS: VMC and fixed-node DMC for the beryllium atom"
abstract: >-
  Variational and fixed-node diffusion Monte Carlo for the beryllium atom
  in JAX, built around one question: of the radial freedoms in a compact
  multi-determinant ansatz, which ones change the nodal surface, and by
  how much.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Agus
    given-names: Francesco
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-13"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kauma03/be-nqs-nodal-study"
keywords:
  - quantum Monte Carlo
  - variational Monte Carlo
  - fixed-node diffusion Monte Carlo
  - neural quantum states
  - nodal surface
  - beryllium
